@startuml
title V1.2 - Transaction Template 与 DURABLE JDBC 幂等闭环

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

participant "IdempotencyExecutor" as EXEC
participant "DistributedLock\n(optional short lock)" as LOCK
participant "TransactionCoordinator" as TXC
participant "TransactionExecutor" as TX
database "Idempotency DB\nJDBC Repository" as IDEM
participant "BusinessService" as BIZ
database "Business DB\nsame local transaction resource" as DB

== Tx-A：短事务抢占 ==
EXEC -> LOCK : optional short coordination
LOCK -> TX : REQUIRES_NEW\nidempotency-state
TX -> IDEM : tryAcquire / tryRecover\nPROCESSING
IDEM --> TX : ACQUIRED(owner,version)
TX --> LOCK : COMMIT
LOCK --> EXEC : release short lock

== Tx-B：业务 + SUCCESS 同事务 ==
EXEC -> TXC : executeRequired(routeKey)
TXC -> TX : REQUIRED\nidempotency-business:{namespace}
TX -> DB : BEGIN / JOIN
TX -> BIZ : callback(IdempotencyContext)
BIZ -> DB : business writes
BIZ --> TX : result
TX -> IDEM : markSuccess(owner,version)\ntransaction-bound Connection

alt markSuccess == UPDATED
    IDEM --> TX : UPDATED
    TX -> DB : COMMIT / participate outer tx
    TX --> TXC : result
    TXC --> EXEC : EXECUTED / RECOVERED
else STALE_OWNER / ALREADY_FINAL / PROVIDER_ERROR
    IDEM --> TX : completion rejected
    TX -> DB : ROLLBACK
    TX --> TXC : CompletionRejectedException
    TXC --> EXEC : OWNERSHIP_LOST / REPOSITORY_ERROR
end

== 业务失败：Tx-B rollback + Tx-C ==
EXEC -> TXC : executeRequired
TXC -> TX : REQUIRED
TX -> BIZ : callback
BIZ --> TX : business exception
TX -> DB : ROLLBACK
TX --> EXEC : original business exception
EXEC -> TX : REQUIRES_NEW\nidempotency-state
TX -> IDEM : markFailed(owner,version)
IDEM --> TX : UPDATED
TX --> EXEC : COMMIT
EXEC --> EXEC : EXECUTION_FAILED

== Commit unknown ==
EXEC -> TXC : Tx-B commit
TXC -> TX : commit
TX --> TXC : COMMIT_UNKNOWN
TXC --> EXEC : TRANSACTION_COMMIT_UNKNOWN
note right of EXEC
Do NOT mark FAILED immediately.
Keep PROCESSING until next query
or timeout recovery.
end note

note bottom
V1.2 已实现：
Tx-A = REQUIRES_NEW
Tx-B = REQUIRED business + SUCCESS
Tx-C = REQUIRES_NEW FAILED

前提：业务表与幂等表必须属于同一个本地事务资源。
end note
@enduml
